 "description": "<p>Two hundred minutes on one charge. That number deserves the opening line because most toys in this category land between sixty and ninety — this wand carries roughly triple the stamina, and everything else about it is built around the assumption that you will not be near a charger.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator pink\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_5_5d8c4741-9f8b-434e-bb6e-f1e692a1ec64_480x480.jpg?v=1689565965\"></p>\n<p>The food-grade silicone shell is the second headline: a material rating usually reserved for kitchenware, applied here to the surfaces that touch skin. Multiple intensity gears walk the output from gentle to forceful, and the step between gears is wide enough that each one feels like a distinct destination rather than a nudge.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator pink\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_4_db7cd2f8-b7d9-49e1-8348-4c7cdd73f475_480x480.jpg?v=1689565962\"></p>\n<p>Full-body waterproofing covers submersion, the frame is sized to hide in a wash bag, and USB charging tops the battery from any port you own. For travel weeks or simply bad charging habits, the runtime does the forgiving.</p>\n<p><img style=\"float: none\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator pink\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_6_d08743e8-1c72-4bac-931e-85d8a3bc12f1_480x480.jpg?v=1689565968\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Battery: 200 minutes of continuous use per charge</li>\n<li>Material: food-grade silicone</li>\n<li>Settings: multiple intensity gears</li>\n<li>Charging: USB</li>\n<li>Waterproof: full-body</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img style=\"float: none\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator pink\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_2_785a44cf-e755-47a8-b4f0-f0e74cc5d07a_480x480.jpg?v=1689565959\"><br />\n<img alt=\"ro